      <div class="four-m-card"><span class="four-m-label">Muscle</span><p>A repaired gut absorbs the protein and nutrients your muscle protocol depends on. The cleanest diet on a damaged gut is wasted spending.</p></div>
      <div class="four-m-card"><span class="four-m-label">Mitigate</span><p>Repairs the gut barrier that controls what enters your bloodstream from the GI tract. The single most upstream intervention in the entire 4M framework.</p></div>
      <div class="four-m-card"><span class="four-m-label">Motivate</span><p>Energy returns. The chronic-low-grade-feeling-bad lifts. Sex drive often returns as the gut-brain axis normalizes testosterone signaling.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lifetime-usage">
      <h4>Why you'll want this for life</h4>
      <p>Your gut barrier turns over every 3–5 days — fast tissue, fast damage, fast repair. Every meal, every alcoholic drink, every dose of antibiotics, every week of high stress nicks the gut lining. The 4-week repair cycle restores it. The 50-week year keeps damaging it. The men who run one cycle and stop are back to baseline within months. Gut maintenance isn't a project — it's an ongoing biological practice.</p>
